You are analysing a conversation between a brand consultant (Abija) and a customer who wants to create a brand for their business.

Extract all the brand-relevant information that has been mentioned so far. Return a JSON object with these fields:
- business_name: the name of the business (null if not mentioned)
- description: what the business does (null if not mentioned)
- industry: the industry or sector (null if not mentioned)
- target_audience: who the business serves (null if not mentioned)
- style_keywords: list of style/aesthetic words mentioned (empty list if none)
- mood: the overall brand feel they want, e.g. "modern and bold" (null if not mentioned)
- conversation_stage: one of "greeting", "business_description", "industry_refine", "target_audience", "style_preferences", "summary_confirm", "complete"
- ready_to_generate: true only if the customer has confirmed they're ready to generate

Stage rules:
- "greeting" — no business info yet
- "business_description" — we know the business name or what it does
- "industry_refine" — we know the business and need to clarify industry/audience
- "target_audience" — industry is clear, audience is being discussed or known
- "style_preferences" — audience is known, discussing brand style/feel
- "summary_confirm" — all info gathered, Abija has summarised and asked for confirmation
- "complete" — customer confirmed, ready to generate

